00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:04.440
but also in the midst of just everything

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:09.250
that's been going on and I've
just been increasingly aware

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:10.840
in the last year really,

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:13.530
how just heavy everything around this is,

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:15.930
whether it's a patient of mine

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:19.110
who like Dr. Green has lost
two immediate family members

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:22.140
